window.products.push({"id":1056151,"name":"Chocolate Mold,8 Cavity Heart Shaped Candy Mold Holder Kit, Silicone Mold for Cake Decoration, Cupcake Topper, Candy, Chocolate, Wax Making Crafting D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y0D8CHQ2L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Product parameters: Material: Silicone Quantity: 2pcs Color: as shown High-quality silicone baking mold, soft and elastic, safe and environmentally friendly, not easy to stick to hands, durable, not easy to fade, and can be reused. The mold is easy to use, and the baking saves time and effort. Just mix the ingredients and pour them into the mold to form a heart-shaped diamond mousse, making DIY easy and fun, exquisite and beautiful. Love design Simple and romantic love shape, not only can be folded and placed on the grill without damage, but also easy to disassemble and quickly clean, it is an ideal choice for accessories. multiple usage Heart-shaped silicone molds can be used as chocolate molds, pudding molds, jelly molds, ice cream molds, etc. or other desserts. Suitable for many occasions Precautions: 1. It is strictly forbidden to approach sharp weapons. 2. It is strictly forbidden to consume olive oil. 3. It is strictly forbidden to use the microwave Crisp key. 4. It is strictly forbidden to use steel wire balls or other metal cleaning tools to clean. 5. It is strictly forbidden to directly touch the open flame or close to the heat source (such as the heating tube of the oven). It is recommended that you place the mold on the upper side of the middle of the oven when baking, and keep at least 5cm distance from the heating tube. About how to use silicone molds 1. How to demould? Pour the prepared mousse into the mold and put it in a freezer at -18℃~-30℃ for 6-8 hours, then take it out and flip it directly over the mold. 2. How to clean the silicone mold? Use detergent or put it in the dishwasher after use. 3. Can it be put in the oven? The mold can withstand -40℃~230℃, and can be used for baking products and frozen mousse.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y0D8CHQ2L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gelible","source_asin":"B08FJ1CVNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FJ1CVNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FJ1CVNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
