window.products.push({"id":1056162,"name":"Moonovator EcoBottles – 100% Pure Copper Water Bottles | Easy-To-Use and Carry, Fancy Prints | Non-Insulated Bottles with Health Benefits and Emphasiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYxP9nE3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Eco Bottle strives to encourage healthy-drinking habits among school-goers and extend the benefits of drinking from a copper bottle to children. On top of that, it is about raising awareness regarding the environment getting interrupted by human interventions. This bottle comes with a meaning and a theme behind it. Pollution in seas and oceans is caused by unplanned disposal of waste, oil spills, and fertilizer run-offs from industries. This results in the death of aquatic plants and loss of food and habitat of sea turtles. This bottle makes a plea to dispose of your waste in the right way so it does not reach our oceans and other water bodies. It is a symbol of change and responsibility towards nature. Extend the benefits of this wonderful product to your children. Extremely well-made and visually appealing in its design and colors, this is the kind of bottle your kids should flaunt among their friends. This bottle is reusable, non-insulated, and can be used indoors and outdoors. Thanks to its healing properties, copper bottles do even more for health. They can improve your immune system, aid digestion, and help you absorb iron. What a fun way to spread knowledge, looking cool and getting healthy - all with one copper bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BYxP9nE3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonshotjr","source_asin":"B08KGS941S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KGS941S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KGS941S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
