window.products.push({"id":1056296,"name":"WENKO Portable Dehumidifier Cube Design, Compact and Rechargeable Dehumidifier for Bathroom, Closet, Bedroom, Garage, Covers up to 2800 Cubic Feet, 2.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uqSz3MOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The design dehumidifier Cube from WENKO in natural beige ensures less moisture and en even better atmosphere of well-being! And in doing so, the modern air dehumidifier fits elegantly into any room and creates an optical highlight with its trendy cube shape. Particularly practical: The dehumidifier is suitable for a multitude of different applications! Whether in the car, mobile home or camper, windows that are misted up or even frozen from the inside now belong to the past. The dehumidifier extracts humidity from the vehicle interior like a magnet. The times of cold and damp cellars and living rooms are also over. The moisture killer offers intensive protection for walls, furniture and fabrics against moisture, and unpleasant odours. As a result, it additionally prevents rust and stains, and ensures a pleasant climate in the cellar, bathroom, bedroom and all other rooms as well as in wardrobes. The clever dehumidifier is ideally suitable for rooms sized up to 80 m. The moisture killer contains 1, 000 g of calcium chloride, which begins to extract moisture from the environment immediately after being set up. The water collected in the room dehumidifier an be reliably read off at any time by means of the integrated water level indicator and is proof of the efficiency of the WENKO moisture killer. The de-humidifier completely does without electricity. It extracts humidity from the environmental air for up to 3 months. Of course, suitable refill packs are available from WENKO under the article numbers 50250100 and 50251100. Permanent dehumidifying over a period of several months or years is therefore quite easily possible. The expert jury of the Plus X Award has honoured the WENKO room dehumidifier Cube for 2017.This excellent award was given in the categories design and functionality. Today, the Plus X Award is the world's most significant innovation award for technology, sports and lifestyle. The prerequisite for winningThis award is: The product must be of high quality, functional and contemporary design. So you can be sure that with the WENKO room dehumidifier Cube you are buying a high-quality, attractive and excellent product with quality seal. Material: Casing: Acrylonitrile-Butadiene-Styrene (ABS), Calcium Chloride: Calcium chloride, Cage: Acrylonitrile-Butadiene-Styrene (ABS) Colour: Casing: Beige, Calcium Chloride: White, Cage: Anthracite Dimensions L/H/W: 16. 5 x 15. 7 x 16. 5 cm Net weight: 1400 g","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uqSz3MOWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WENKO","source_asin":"B0B8NDXDBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NDXDBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NDXDBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
