window.products.push({"id":1056355,"name":"Artificial Rose Flowers,CATTREE Budding Fake Flowers Bouquet 5 Branch 10 Heads Artificial Silk Fake Flowers Leaf Rose Bridal Home Garden Office Dining","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iiLaFaa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cattree Artificial Silk fake flowers not only have the beautiful appearance of flowers,but also last longer life time than fresh flowers. They stay as beautiful as the day you get them and you do not have to worry about breaking any leaves or peddles or stems. NEVER FADE: Artificial Roses each flower have 10 heads mix color simulation roses with bright colors and unique shape, are dignified, elegant, beautiful, vivid realistic and lifelike, will remain beautiful year after year. They will never wither or fall, can greatly meet your demands of every season.It's a great decorations for scenes such as home, office, wedding, party etc. Specification: Category: Artificial 10 Head Mini RoseMaterial: Silk Cloth, Plastic, Iron WireFlower Height : 12\" / 30cm (Approx.)Package: 10 Head Artificial Rose Bouquet, no vase included.Cattree stands behind all of its products with 'One Year Warranty' and super customer service.If for any reason you are not satisfied, please don’t hesitate to contact our customer service for help. Warm Tips: ★The stem of artificial flowers can be adjusted its length according to requirements: Bent and pruned for shorter; Graft branches or put into newspaper or stone in vase to increase pad height.★Artificial flowers may be squeezed and deformed in transit, but it will be recover with slight adjustment after displaying it.You can also use boiled water to smoke deformed flowers,use the hair dryer with cold wind to dry it.★There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time, we suggest that you don't need to wash it by hands and don't wash too frequently. You can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust.★Please don't put it under strong sunshine.You'd better to dry it by the natural wind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iiLaFaa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CATTREE","source_asin":"B079688LSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079688LSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079688LSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
