window.products.push({"id":1056451,"name":"TIMEMORE French Press Coffee & Tea Maker 15oz(450ml), Heat Resistant Thickened Borosilicate Glass Coffee Press with 1 Filter Screen and Stainless Stee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OnLiTN+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable French Press Makers - Glass that is too thin or cheaply made would let out the heat almost instantly, which would affect the taste of your coffee. So, our french coffee carafe is made of heat-resistant borosilicate glass which keeps the water hot during the brewing process. Also, the thickened glass bottom tremendously extends the product service life. All of the parts are BPA-free. Stainless Steel Filtration Systems - Poorly made filters often break which results in getting a mug filled with coffee grounds. This is why we developed a high-density stainless steel filter(0.35 mm) that ensures that no coffee grounds are getting in your coffee anymore. Experience an incomparable delicious, smooth and full-flavored coffee. The filter screen is easy to disassemble and clean. Clear Precise Scale Line Design - Our coffee press maker features an exact scale line, so you can accurately prepare the amount of coffee or tea according to your needs. You can prepare your own fresh coffee just as perfect as coffee made by professionals. The frosted cup body comes with 300ml and 450ml precise scale line. Recommended maximum capacity is 15.2 ounce/450ml. Unique U-shaped Spout Structure - An u-shaped spout allows coffee to flow smoothly without dripping onto your table. Frosted surface shell, effective heat insulation, not easy to leave water stains and fingerprints. Vacuum layered with double-wall construction that retains your coffee hot for longer. The individual sized easy to carry which will be perfect for trips, camping adventures or at work. Ideals Gift For Coffee Lovers - This best coffee maker press will make a great impression for someone that loves real tasty coffee. A great gift for family & friends to give on Housewarmings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Birthdays, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year Present! Besides as a coffee maker, it is also handy appliances to make juice, tea, frothed milk, hot chocolate and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OnLiTN+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIMEMORE","source_asin":"B09987X8YW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09987X8YW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09987X8YW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
