window.products.push({"id":1056695,"name":"Hanukkah Gnome Jewish Gnome Decorations for Home, 2 Pcs Handmade Mr & Mrs Chanukah Swedish Tomte Gnomes Plush Table Ornaments Hanukkah Gift Hanukkah P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzXLqGxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adorable Hanukkah Gnome Set】- In folklore, gnome is representative for happiness, love, faith and will bring good luck to families. This Dwarf elf couple have bright colors and cute appearance, surely add a unique vibe to your interior. They features long white beard/hair, soft felt body, and a hat decorated with star of David, which adds festive atmosphere, perfect gnome doll for the holiday and winter season. 【Unique Design & Perfect Size】- With the unique feature and design, this Chanukah gnome will definitely become a newest addition to gnome family! Each gnome is about 11.4 inches tall from hat top to bottom, 3.2 inches wide, weighs 3.2 ounces and has a weighted bottom so that it can stand on its own, perfect festive ornaments to your table and home decoration. 【Handmade Crafted Gnomes】- The handmade plush gnome is completely hand-cut and hand-sewn. Made of high-quality material, it has a soft felt plush body, fiber long white beard/hair, wooden nose and tall hat with a wire in it for posing. The small gnome is filled with plush at the bottom to add weight, making it suitable to be placed nicely on any flat surface. 【Perfect Gift for Adding Festive Atmosphere】- The adorable gnome will be a unique gift for anyone during Chanukah and holiday time. Its delicate appearance and suitable size make it an essential decoration for tiered tray, desk, table, shelf, fireplace etc. Also it’s a wonderful gift with lucky meaning that add fun and festive touch. You can give this lucky to your best friends, children, and parents. 【After-Sales Service】- Each package includes a male & female Gnomes and will be packed in a quality box for safe transportation. If you have any dissatisfaction with the product or any suggestions, please feel free to contact us through amazon message center, we will reply you and solve your problems asap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PzXLqGxZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siawoy","source_asin":"B0B8D63B59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8D63B59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8D63B59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
