window.products.push({"id":1056767,"name":"Dragonfly K22 All-In-One Professional Chef - Multi-Purpose - 14 Piece Stainless Steel Kitchen Knives Set - Cutlery Knife Block Set With Wooden Block","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M8jS9ugiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DRAGONFLY is a professional kitchen knife manufacturer with more than 20 years experiences.  We love cooking and understand how important is the knives when we cook. Through out the years, we keep improving our products in difference aspects to make them fit for cutting variety of food. We hope everyone can enjoy cooking and cook like a professional at the same time. Our well designed products can fit for both professional chefs and customers. Our knives are beautifully crafted with superior materials and razor-sharp edges which can slice through all kinds of food.  The Dragonfly steak knife set is made by high quality stainless steel with ergonomic handles. Razor-sharp edges with serration pattern can slice through different kinds of steaks, from sirloin to rump and ribeye.  14 -pieces knife set include: 8-inch chef's knife 8-inch bread knife 6-inch slicing knife 4.5-inch santoku knife 4.5-inch utility knife 3-inch Paring knife (6) 4.5-inch steak knives 8-inch kitchen shears Woodblock Cutlery Care Tips 1. Wash knives under running water after use. 2. All knives are dishwasher safe. Open dishwasher after cleaning, hot water and vapor may lead to stains and corrosion on blades. 3. Use the right amount of dishwasher detergent to avoid stains. 4. Hand wash is highly recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M8jS9ugiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noraut","source_asin":"B07XMCNJXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XMCNJXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XMCNJXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1056768,"name":"LOKNGXU Vacuum Storage Bags Save Storage Space Bedroom Organization Quilts Blankets Clothes Storage Vacuum Seal Bags with Travel Hand Pump (Small)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QM5rR5ObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"6 Vacuum Storage Bags, Small size 16x24 inches, with a hand pump. The Vacuum Compression Storage Bag can store your quilts, blankets, duvets, towels, clothes, pillows, plush toys and more. Can increase your storage space by 80%. The Storage Bag is designed with heavy duty valve and double airtight zipper for airtight protection. Vacuum Storage Bags are durable and reusable, they can store a variety of items and can also be used in different scenarios, such as traveling, moving, organizing storage, etc., protecting items from moisture, dirt, odor, etc. Our Service: LOKNGXU provides the highest quality and exceptional customer service. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will provide you with the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QM5rR5ObL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKNGXU","source_asin":"B0B289DWML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B289DWML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B289DWML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
