window.products.push({"id":1056883,"name":"Cold Press Juicer, Qvin Slow Masticating Juicer Machines with Big Wide Chute, Nutrient Electric juicer machines Vegetable And Fruit, slow Juicer Machi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":127.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ksmOk-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🕘TIME SAVE: The 76mm (3 inch) wide feeding chute allows for larger ingredients with less cutting, which means less prep time, and also helps to reduce oxidation. The drip-free juice spout helps create mixed juices and to rinse between recipes. 🍹MAKE HEALTHY AND DELICIOUS JUICES: slow cold press technology, which reduces the heat generated by rapid friction. Different from a blender or high speed juicer extractor, it keeps the cell walls of fruits and vegetables, reduces oxidation, and maximizes the retention of nutrition, extract the maximum amount of nutrients, vitamins, taste and juice from minimum amounts of fruits, vegetables, organic leafy greens, nuts and wheatgrass. 🍓UNIQUE COMPACT DESIGN: Compact size is convenient, space-saving alternative to other centrifugal juicers, juice extractor. BPA-Free material, easy to assemble and operate, and easy to clean. Space grey painted housing. 👪BABY HEALTH AND EASY CLEAN: BPA-Free mateiral for food contact parts, 200w powerful motor for high yield and lower noise, compact design for easy clean and assembly 🍇INNOVATIVE PATENT AUGER: The patent auger upgraded spiral system and 60-80 rpm low peed, which perfectly separates the pomace from the juice, and extracts the nutrients from the fruits and vegetables into juice","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ksmOk-eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qvin","source_asin":"B09P7ZTTGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P7ZTTGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P7ZTTGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1056884,"name":"Cool Pillow Insert for Sleeping, Chemotherapy Pillow Cooling Cold Pack, Ice Pack Large, Gel Cold Pack Stay Cold Summer Cold Therapy Compress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CoTyQEXoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Gel pillows use cooling gel to regulate temperature and reduce heat build-up on the surface of the pillow. They may use different designs to accomplish this, including gel pods, laminated gel layers, and gel infusions in the pillow material. Gel is most often used in memory foam pillows, which are known for their heat retention. If you’re struggling to maintain a neutral temperature while sleeping, a gel pillow may be the answer. Gel pillows come in various models, including solid memory foam, shredded memory foam, and microfiber. Despite their claims, not all gel pillows succeed in keeping sleepers cool overnight. It’s important to do your research to ensure you’re getting a product that works. Medical pillows are bed accessories that provide comfort and support. In fact, medical pillows assist with preventing several prevalent conditions, with specific regards to neck pain and back pain. It is not good for your neck to sleep without a pillow. It adds stress on your back and neck, making it hard for your spine to maintain its natural curve. Sleeping without a pillow can keep your head flat. This may reduce some stress on your neck and promote better alignment. But this doesn't apply to other sleeping positions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CoTyQEXoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HI FINE CARE","source_asin":"B08YDJFN5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDJFN5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDJFN5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
