window.products.push({"id":1056895,"name":"OCTROT Heated Electric Throw Blankets, Plush Flannel Heating Electric Throw Blanket for Adults, Heated Fuzzy Sherpa Blanket Throw Electric, 10 Heat Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+NsCevQjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLUFFY FUZZY HEATED THROW BLANKET: For cold winter, it is a great choice to have a thick plush electric throw blanket as a protection against the bitter cold. The front and back of this electric blanket is made of 240GSM flannel and 220GSM sherpa. The sherpa heated blanket can ensure a soft touch while retaining heat effectively. Even after turning off the power, our heated blanket throw electric will continue to keep you warm and comfortable with extra temperature in cold weather all the time. FAST HEATING & OVERHEATING PROTECTION: Our heating blankets provide instant warmth and coziness with high-quality heating wire. Not only does it heat up faster (5 mins to 131℉), it also can meet your needs with 10 optional levels (59℉-131℉). The wire is arranged in a U shape for even heat distribution to offer you the ultimate comfort. More importantly, the heated sherpa blanket is designed with a overheating protection which can protect you from safety hazards. Please rest assured to use! AUTO-OFF FUNCTION: For the convenience of the elderly and children, the controller adopts a simple design to make it user-friendly. With simple buttons and LED displays, you can easily adjust the temperature and time to customize your personal comfort. And it can be flexibly selected between 1h, 2h, 4h, 6h, and 8h. Safer and more energy-saving with auto-off timing (8H) leave you peace of mind. This is an ideal choice for winter night use. MULTIPURPOSE USE: Our plush electric blanket features a 100-inch extra-long detachable cord, which means it can be used flexibly in the bedroom, couch, office, camping, or picnic. When you want to stand or walk, you can snap the buttons on both sides of the cozy electric blanket together, so that the electric blanket can be fixed on your body and keep you warm at all times. What's more, we provide a beautiful package, which is a great gift for your family and friends. WASHABLE ELECTRIC BLANKET: The soft heat electric blanket can be washed by machine on a gentle cycle after the power cord and controller being detached. Do not dry, dry clean, bleach, or iron. Do not connect the power supply until the warming electric blanket is completely dry. We guarantee the quality of heating electric throw blankets and provide after-sales services that satisfy you. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+NsCevQjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OCTROT","source_asin":"B0B28JS4LF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1056895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B28JS4LF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B28JS4LF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
